  "sourceTitle": "Steak Pierre",
  "sourceText": "Steak Pierre\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 12:19am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 lbs. ground beef\nBleu cheese, crumbled\nSalt\npepper to taste\n1 can cream of mushroom soup\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Flatten beef into 6 x 6 inch squares. Crumble bleu cheese on top. Roll and tuck to form little meatloaves. Place in oven proof dish. Pour soup over loaves. Bake at 350 degrees for 30 to 45 minutes.",
